WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.431 --> 00:00:03.281
Unit twenty-two. Water-Borne Diseases!

2
00:00:04.227 --> 00:00:08.341
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.391 --> 00:00:11.566
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:15.441
Today we learn about Water-Borne Diseases. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.173 --> 00:00:19.240
Cholera. Say it with me. Cholera!

6
00:00:22.796 --> 00:00:26.196
Typhoid. Say it with me. Typhoid!

7
00:00:29.717 --> 00:00:33.183
Diarrhea. Say it with me. Diarrhea!

8
00:00:36.628 --> 00:00:40.845
Contaminated water. Say it with me. Contaminated water!

9
00:00:44.371 --> 00:00:47.288
Boiling. Say it with me. Boiling!

10
00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:54.577
Sanitation. Say it with me. Sanitation!

11
00:00:58.062 --> 00:01:01.362
ORS. Say it with me. ORS!

12
00:01:04.844 --> 00:01:08.444
Handwashing. Say it with me. Handwashing!

13
00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:22.257
Contaminated water can spread cholera, typhoid, and diarrhea. Boiling water, sanitation, and handwashing prevent them. Oral rehydration solution (ORS) replaces lost fluids.

14
00:01:22.307 --> 00:01:25.267
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:26.475 --> 00:01:31.639
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.689 --> 00:01:32.839
Diarrhea!

17
00:01:33.788 --> 00:01:38.809
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.859 --> 00:01:40.000
ORS!

19
00:01:40.693 --> 00:01:47.319
Did you know? Oral rehydration solution is a simple mix of water, salt and sugar that has saved millions of lives!

20
00:01:47.369 --> 00:01:49.377
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:58.392
Think and answer. What is ORS and why is it important?

22
00:01:58.442 --> 00:01:59.592
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.647 --> 00:02:05.074
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:07.646
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

